{'symbol': 'FICO', 'date': '2021-11-02 08:00:00', 'title': "JIM WEHMANN, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF SCORES AT FICO, JOINS MORTGAGE BANKER'S ASSOCIATION BOARD", 'text': "SAN JOSE, CALIF., NOV. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEADING ANALYTICS SOFTWARE FIRM FICO\xa0(NYSE:FICO), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT JIM WEHMANN, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF SCORES AT FICO, HAS JOINED THE MORTGAGE BANKER'S ASSOCIATION (MBA) BOARD."}